# Build artefacts and caches. Everything else must stay: this is a pnpm
# workspace, and pnpm-workspace.yaml globs apps/* and packages/*, so removing
# a sibling package's package.json would break `pnpm install` at the root —
# which is where Vercel installs from when a project's Root Directory is a
# workspace member.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.swc
.git
scripts/results

# Gitignored, local-only WIP scaffolds — never committed, so they're not
# real sibling workspace members. The CLI uploads the local disk regardless
# of git tracking state, so without this they ride along into every deploy
# and their incomplete package.json files break the frozen-lockfile install
# for every app, not just their own. Keep this list in sync with the
# apps/* and packages/* entries in .gitignore.
apps/community-api
apps/community
